# The dungeon's switch room of level $10 (act 5, stage 2): the swinging
# handholds and moving pieces of kind $3B (its wait routine $83:C21C and
# its helpers $83:FB57, $83:FB89, $83:FBDA). Aladdin and the camera are
# placed (pokes of the player's x and y and the camera's x) on the floor
# at x $0B80, a spot the level's own path walks through, so the room's
# placements are created as the game creates them; then he jumps at them.
load build/aladdin/states/stage_a5_s2.state
wait 2
poke 0008E7 80,0B
poke 0008EA 80,00
poke 001773 00,0B
wait 100
hold RIGHT 20
hold B 40
wait 60
hold B+RIGHT 40
wait 60
load build/aladdin/states/stage_a5_s2.state
wait 2
poke 0008E7 80,0B
poke 0008EA 80,00
poke 001773 00,0B
wait 100
hold RIGHT 60
hold B+RIGHT 30
hold RIGHT 30
hold B 30
wait 60
